      </memberdef>
    </sectiondef>
    <briefdescription>
<para>Inner timer that drives async connect retries. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Fires every 100 ms on the JUCE message thread. On each tick it reads the port from <ref refid="struct_app_model" kindref="compound">AppModel</ref> and calls <computeroutput>connectToSocket</computeroutput>. Stops itself when the connection succeeds or when <computeroutput>maxAttempts</computeroutput> is reached.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>All callbacks — NEXUS PROCESS MESSAGE THREAD. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
